{"4183770":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"CELESTAY Craft&Slowlife","steam_appid":4183770,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5432100],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CELESTAY is not a clicker-style incremental game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a post-apocalyptic world, it is a desktop companion with idle elements, where you can enjoy the gentle passage of time and music.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish to gather materials, build your home, and watch the story unfold little by little.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/5428f0c03fe6ad1e3a84a212878b2f0e.poster.avif?t=1793628825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/5428f0c03fe6ad1e3a84a212878b2f0e.webm?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/5428f0c03fe6ad1e3a84a212878b2f0e.mp4?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can trade the fish you catch for resources and useful items.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/44f7aad2dd07510c5d9d882ab761caff.poster.avif?t=1793628825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/44f7aad2dd07510c5d9d882ab761caff.webm?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/44f7aad2dd07510c5d9d882ab761caff.mp4?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build your home using fish and wood gathered through fishing. As your home grows higher, the scenery you can see will begin to change.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/76a2ce9d91435835f676ce519fab1751.poster.avif?t=1793628825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/76a2ce9d91435835f676ce519fab1751.webm?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/76a2ce9d91435835f676ce519fab1751.mp4?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your house grows taller, constellations once hidden from view begin to appear. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits beyond that sky...? — Witness the story of the stars.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/2a0921cbfb8a15dff33da2e237b3cc2e.poster.avif?t=1793628825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/2a0921cbfb8a15dff33da2e237b3cc2e.webm?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/2a0921cbfb8a15dff33da2e237b3cc2e.mp4?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CELESTAY is not a clicker-style incremental game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a post-apocalyptic world, it is a desktop companion with idle elements, where you can enjoy the gentle passage of time and music.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish to gather materials, build your home, and watch the story unfold little by little.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/5428f0c03fe6ad1e3a84a212878b2f0e.poster.avif?t=1793628825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/5428f0c03fe6ad1e3a84a212878b2f0e.webm?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/5428f0c03fe6ad1e3a84a212878b2f0e.mp4?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can trade the fish you catch for resources and useful items.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/44f7aad2dd07510c5d9d882ab761caff.poster.avif?t=1793628825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/44f7aad2dd07510c5d9d882ab761caff.webm?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/44f7aad2dd07510c5d9d882ab761caff.mp4?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build your home using fish and wood gathered through fishing. As your home grows higher, the scenery you can see will begin to change.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/76a2ce9d91435835f676ce519fab1751.poster.avif?t=1793628825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/76a2ce9d91435835f676ce519fab1751.webm?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/76a2ce9d91435835f676ce519fab1751.mp4?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your house grows taller, constellations once hidden from view begin to appear. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits beyond that sky...? — Witness the story of the stars.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/2a0921cbfb8a15dff33da2e237b3cc2e.poster.avif?t=1793628825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/2a0921cbfb8a15dff33da2e237b3cc2e.webm?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4183770\/extras\/2a0921cbfb8a15dff33da2e237b3cc2e.mp4?t=1793628825\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"CELESTAY is a cozy desktop companion with idle elements. Fish for wood and other materials in a world lost beneath the sea, and build a little home toward the sky. Meet dear friends, discover new views, and slowly uncover why the world sank—all to the gentle sounds of waves and hammers.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, French, Italian, German, 